    <string name="faq_room_creation">房間建立</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_create">如何建立3D房間？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_create_answer">Tap Photo → 3D on the home screen toolbar (or Create Room from Photo in the empty state), then take or select a photo of your room. You\'ll see two options for creating your 3D room.</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_take_photo">如何拍照來建立房間？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_take_photo_answer">When creating a room, choose Take a Photo. You can pick Standard (1x) or Wide Angle (0.5× ultra-wide). Hold your device steady and tap capture. The photo is then used to build your 3D room.</string>
    <string name="faq_two_methods">兩種房間建立方式是什麼？</string>
    <string name="faq_two_methods_answer">選擇照片後，您可以選擇：1) AI 驅動的 3D 房間 - 使用人工智慧自動建立逼真的 3D 房間，或 2) 手動設定 - 您自己繪製房間邊界以獲得更多控制。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_ai_room">什麼是 AI 驅動的 3D 房間？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_ai_room_answer">AI Room uses GeoCalib for camera calibration and Depth Anything for metric depth to build a textured 3D room from your photo. Pick a photo and the app handles the rest; no drawing required.</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_manual_room">什麼是手動設定？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_manual_room_answer">手動設定時，您在照片上繪製房間牆壁的輪廓。這樣您可以更精確地控制 3D 房間的外觀。當您想自己微調房間形狀時非常有用。</string>
    <string name="faq_which_method_better">我該選哪種方式？</string>
    <string name="faq_which_method_better_answer">建議先試 AI 驅動 - 更快，對大多數房間效果很好。如果結果不太理想，用手動設定在您想要的位置繪製牆壁。兩種都可以試試看您更喜歡哪種！</string>
    <string name="faq_best_photos">什麼樣的照片效果最好？</string>
    <string name="faq_best_photos_answer">為獲得最佳效果，請在光線充足的環境下拍攝，並保持相機水平。盡量拍攝整個房間，包括地板、牆壁和天花板邊緣。避免模糊或昏暗的照片。</string>
    <string name="faq_generation_failing">為什麼我的房間產生失敗？</string>
    <string name="faq_generation_failing_answer">如果照片太暗、模糊或沒有顯示足夠的房間特徵，房間產生可能會失敗。請嘗試在更好的光線下以更寬的角度拍攝新照片。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_many_rooms">我可以建立多少個房間？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_many_rooms_answer">你最多可以建立20個房間。刪除舊房間以騰出新空間。主畫面頂部會顯示房間數量與已使用的儲存空間。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_segmentation">什麼是傢俱分割？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_segmentation_answer">Furniture segmentation runs from the room viewer via the Fit button. By default one primary item is auto-segmented. In full-video mode, select detected items first; Segment then creates transparent cutouts only for those pieces.</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_segment">如何在房間檢視器中分割家具？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_segment_answer">Tap Fit in the room viewer. For a quick check it auto-segments the main item. To pick specific pieces: summon controls, enable full-video mode, point the camera at the furniture, tap detection boxes, then tap Segment. Tap Done (top-right) to exit.</string>
    <string name="faq_not_detected">為什麼我的傢俱沒有被偵測到？</string>
    <string name="faq_not_detected_answer">傢俱偵測在清晰、光線充足且傢俱明顯可見的照片中效果最佳。確保傢俱沒有被部分遮擋或與背景融合。</string>
    <string name="faq_multiple_pieces">我可以分割多件傢俱嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_multiple_pieces_answer">Yes! In full-video mode you can tap several detection boxes, then tap Segment once to cut out all selected pieces together over your 3D room. You can also segment items one at a time using the default Fit flow.</string>
    <string name="faq_room_fitment">如何確認傢俱是否合適？</string>
    <string name="faq_room_fitment_answer">分割後可在 3D 房間中縮放和移動去背。全影片模式下，分割會將所選物件疊加在房間上，便於同時對比多件家具與空間。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_view">如何檢視我的3D房間？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_view_answer">在主畫面點按任意房間開啟 3D 檢視器。拖動環視，捏合縮放。點按房間可喚出更多控制項（重新置中、尺規、Capture）。右下角金色 Fit 按鈕始終可見。</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_place">如何在房間中放置傢俱？</string>
    <string name="faq_how_to_place_answer">點擊分割後，選取的家具會以疊圖形式出現在房間裡。拖曳可定位，雙指縮放可調整大小，旋轉可調整方向。</string>
    <string name="faq_sample_room">我可以使用範例房間嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_sample_room_answer">可以！應用程式提供範例房間供你體驗。從探索部分存取它們，無需先建立自己的房間即可嘗試傢俱佈置。</string>
    <string name="faq_accuracy">3D模型有多準確？</string>
    <string name="faq_accuracy_answer">3D 房間是根據一張照片生成的估計結果。房間尺寸可作為參考，但不是專業測量等級。家具測量在支援 AR 或深度的手機上最可靠。</string>
    <string name="faq_adjust_dimensions">我可以調整房間尺寸嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_adjust_dimensions_answer">You cannot edit AI room dimensions manually. After saving, summon controls and tap the ruler to see estimated width, height, and depth. During the pre-save preview, dimension chips are hidden—save the room first, then reopen to see measurements. Manual rooms follow the boundaries you draw.</string>
    <string name="faq_furniture_measurements">傢俱與測量</string>
    <string name="faq_ar_assisted_sizing">什麼是 AR 輔助傢俱尺寸？</string>
    <string name="faq_ar_assisted_sizing_answer">Tap Fit to segment furniture first. Use the sizing control in the summoned toolbar when you want room-relative scale. On phones with AR/depth support, the app uses live camera depth; without depth, furniture measurements are approximate.</string>
    <string name="faq_measurement_pill">畫面上小小的測量資訊是什麼？</string>
    <string name="faq_measurement_pill_answer">家具尺寸小標籤只會在尺寸模式開啟且 app 拿到可用的即時高度估計時出現。尺子按鈕會以小卡片顯示目前房間的寬度、高度與深度。在不支援 AR 的手機上，這些讀數會更不可靠，尤其是家具尺寸。</string>
    <string name="faq_reset_overlay_scale">偵測遮罩的縮放看起來不對，怎麼辦？</string>
    <string name="faq_reset_overlay_scale_answer">There is no overflow menu now. If the overlay looks off, tap Done to exit Fit and tap Fit again, or pinch the furniture manually to fine-tune its size.</string>
    <string name="faq_pinch_overlay_size">雙指縮放已分割的家具時會發生什麼？</string>
    <string name="faq_pinch_overlay_size_answer">雙指縮放會讓家具疊圖變大或變小。如果尺寸模式已開啟且 Furni 小標籤可見，這個小標籤會更新成目前依房間比例調整後的家具估計尺寸。如果尺寸模式未開啟，雙指縮放只會改變螢幕上疊圖的視覺大小。</string>
    <string name="faq_depth_aware_room_photo">用應用程式內建相機拍照會比較好嗎？</string>
    <string name="faq_depth_aware_room_photo_answer">會。在支援的裝置上，建立房間時選拍照而非從相簿挑圖，可使用內建相機搭配深度（若裝置提供），有助於 3D 房間的建立與比例。</string>
    <string name="faq_placement_intelligence">擺放智慧與美學</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_placement_intelligence">什麼是「擺放智慧」（Placement Intelligence）？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_is_placement_intelligence_answer">While Fit is active in supported 3D room viewers, a Placement Intelligence card shows whether the detected furniture fits within the room dimensions. Tap the header to expand full details, or leave it collapsed to save space.</string>
    <string name="faq_furniture_color_aesthetic">美學評分用的顏色怎麼來的？</string>
    <string name="faq_furniture_color_aesthetic_answer">App 會對 AI 家具去背（與即時分割疊加層相同）中可見像素做 RGB 平均，再與從地板、牆面、天花板取樣的顏色比較。若去背尚未就緒，會暫用房間調色板的推斷色，直到分割提供真實取樣。</string>
    <string name="faq_what_do_harmony_contrast_mean">和諧度、對比、風格契合是什麼意思？</string>
    <string name="faq_what_do_harmony_contrast_mean_answer">它們只是簡單的設計啟發規則，不是品味評判。和諧度描述家具顏色與房間主色的關係（例如類似色或互補色）。對比衡量與典型地面、牆面亮度的差異。風格契合把從房間推斷的寬泛風格標籤與預設的「現代／極簡」設定相比，故僅供參考。</string>
    <string name="faq_when_does_aesthetic_score_low">什麼情況下美學分數會偏低或顯示「衝突（clash）」？</string>
    <string name="faq_when_does_aesthetic_score_low_answer">高飽和物件若色相與 App 內的和諧配色規則、以及你房間取樣色不搭，分數往往較低——例如酸綠、洋紅、紫色、安全橘放在偏米色、暖棕調房間，或空間取樣幾乎單色卻仍用刺眼原色。與地板或牆面亮度非常接近（棕上棕、灰上灰）也可能拉低對比，即便你主觀喜歡。若房間被推斷為鄉村風、傳統風，風格契合可能偏低，因為家具設定預設帶現代／極簡標籤。雜亂背景下得到的灰濛濛平均色有時會落在「中性」區間而非衝突。分數僅供提示，實際布置請以肉眼為準。</string>
